; The demo exercises the cache and prints what it kept, its size and its
; hit rate. Running it is the test: it raises if an invariant it asserts
; is broken, and a cram test pinning its exact output would fail every
; time somebody changed a message rather than a behaviour.
(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (deps %{bin:lru})
 (action
  (run %{bin:lru})))
